+    "description": "Discover or request setup of a Hermes native integration (for example Spotify Web API), not desktop-app control. Use inspect first even when its actual tools are unavailable because credentials are missing. configure opens human-owned selection/secure-input cards and supported OAuth; NEVER ask for credentials in chat or guess terminal/config writes. Does not enable tools, change approval, select config providers or install packages. Respect cancelled/unsupported results; do not retry after decline. Saved/authenticated does not prove loaded tools or successful API calls.",
+    "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {
